  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru-verb: {廃棄|はいき}する. A formal term; in everyday speech, {捨|す}てる (throw away) is more common. {廃棄|はいき} implies an official or systematic process of disposal. Can also apply to treaties or agreements: {条約|じょうやく}を{廃棄|はいき}する (abrogate a treaty).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {廃棄|はいき}{処分|しょぶん}: disposal (formal compound)\n- {廃棄|はいき}{物|ぶつ}: waste, discarded materials\n- {核|かく}{廃棄|はいき}: nuclear disarmament\n- {産業|さんぎょう}{廃棄|はいき}{物|ぶつ}: industrial waste",
